[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429122\">2125A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429578\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429442\">5570T80</a></p><p>1. Remove the two knobs.</p><p>2. Adjust the fastening tabs (2a) and separate the outer trim (2b).</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection and keep the trim.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Climate control system controls</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428439\">H80</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044974.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the embellishment\nis not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection and position\nthe trim attaching the retainers.</p><p>Fit the two knobs.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429442\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429578\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429122\">2125A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p>"]]